WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:08.389
Workday is the official system for recording all hours worked, because it connects directly to Cisco's payroll.

00:00:08.389 --> 00:00:14.015
Accurate time in Workday means you are paid correctly, including overtime and on-call pay.

00:00:15.365 --> 00:00:17.919
No other tool is integrated with payroll.

00:00:17.919 --> 00:00:21.531
So hours recorded anywhere else never reach your paycheck.
